# White-label (`@linq/site-config`)

- Brand fields live only in `packages/site-config/src/brand.ts`.
- Catalog lives in `packages/site-config/src/catalog.ts`. Product `brand` must use `brand.name`; SKUs via `sku("CODE")`.
- Apps re-export or import from `@linq/site-config` — do not maintain a second catalog of products or brand strings.
- UI chrome (title, hero, footer, admin shell, cart storage key, order prefix) must read from `brand`.
- To rebrand: edit `brand.ts` (and catalog content if needed), then `npm run build:site-config` for API consumers.
